{"w":2400,"h":3209,"lines":[{"x":0.067961162231303079,"c":1,"t":"This led to a number of problems. Firstly, there was more competition for food, which meant","y":0.084302325670582157,"w":0.72427185058593746,"h":0.016009200621988184},{"w":0.71667149861653645,"y":0.1000873503713372,"x":0.067893105574341153,"t":"that some elephants were suffering from hunger. As there was a limit to the amount of food","h":0.017403477226091035,"c":1},{"x":0.065934308674318209,"y":0.11604488768734278,"w":0.72055302937825516,"c":1,"h":0.018716703991280892,"t":"in the national park, some elephants began looking further afield. Elephants were routinely"},{"y":0.13132067050094032,"h":0.01990757760971873,"t":"knocking down fences around the park, which then had to be repaired at a significant cost.","w":0.71668019612630218,"x":0.065915395545618247,"c":1},{"w":0.69142944335937484,"h":0.017090038644190453,"x":0.069822462376505856,"c":1,"t":"To solve this problem, the decision was made to move dozens of elephants from Majete","y":0.15683107292847021},{"x":0.067961175133468624,"w":0.70873784383138017,"h":0.014677968723380341,"c":1,"y":0.17441860435768874,"t":"National Park to Nkhotakota Wildlife Park, where there were no elephants. But, obviously,"},{"y":0.18889947647354843,"t":"attempting to move significant numbers of elephants to a new home 300 kilometres away is","w":0.72440658569335936,"h":0.018003735289766842,"c":1,"x":0.065956786973774606},{"x":0.067820257640312936,"y":0.20681808863830353,"w":0.14407389322916667,"h":0.015649569740176617,"c":1,"t":"quite a challenge."},{"c":1,"y":0.25284497266733486,"t":"So how did this translocation process work in practice?","w":0.43523188273111979,"h":0.01842277978439566,"x":0.067842437356670379},{"h":0.01767422803837182,"w":0.70884109497070313,"c":1,"y":0.27658150561290351,"x":0.067904638509831347,"t":"Elephants were moved in groups of between eight and twenty, all belonging to one family."},{"t":"Because relationships are very important to elephants, they all had to be moved at the same","x":0.067888222449599023,"y":0.2925559544706563,"w":0.73026011149088543,"h":0.018886762838868809,"c":1},{"t":"time. A team of vets and park rangers flew over the park in helicopters and targeted a group.","y":0.30902250817814447,"w":0.73599660237630216,"x":0.065978655503816028,"h":0.016683791805279236,"c":1},{"t":"which were rounded up and directed to a designated open plain.","h":0.014534884301301454,"x":0.067961165511974619,"y":0.32703488342580078,"w":0.51262135823567712,"c":1},{"h":0.016199376947040545,"c":1,"x":0.067961177941826156,"t":"The vets then used darts to immobilise the elephants - this was a tricky manoeuvre, as they","w":0.72815531412760426,"y":0.35015576324790088},{"w":0.72442891438802082,"t":"not only had to select the right dose of tranquiliser for different-sized elephants but they had","h":0.018031710330570938,"y":0.36494115298378538,"c":1,"x":0.067884928026223104},{"t":"to dart the elephants as they were running around. This also had to be done as quickly as","w":0.71279591878255211,"y":0.38137555016553271,"h":0.018964961161865967,"x":0.06593763273162713,"c":1},{"h":0.019203492636992614,"c":1,"x":0.06786256225634768,"y":0.39791944918945976,"w":0.71282791137695312,"t":"possible so as to minimise the stress caused. As soon as the elephants began to flop onto"},{"x":0.067876001576169409,"t":"the ground, the team moved in to take care of them.","y":0.41545167927621351,"h":0.018076899638428401,"c":1,"w":0.41568412780761721},{"x":0.067890657791882539,"w":0.72828124999999999,"t":"To avoid the risk of suffocation, the team had to make sure none of the elephants were lying","y":0.43832727002370975,"h":0.017370840767833684,"c":1},{"h":0.016199376947040545,"t":"on their chests because their lungs could be crushed in this position. So all the elephants","x":0.067961157900264191,"y":0.45482866030111291,"w":0.71067962646484384,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.73024297078450529,"t":"had to be placed on their sides. One person stayed with each elephant while they waited for","h":0.018672045888930455,"y":0.47063533098520294,"x":0.067890346210756999},{"c":1,"h":0.019272940923863113,"x":0.067876860842976991,"y":0.48645979276534224,"w":0.73027323404947919,"t":"the vets to do checks. It was very important to keep an eye on their breathing - if there were"},{"x":0.067848259579670861,"t":"fewer than six breaths per minute, the elephant would need urgent medical attention. Collars","y":0.50263489390496963,"w":0.73226628621419265,"h":0.019624231166185946,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.017465280075310896,"y":0.51975455276192195,"t":"were fitted to the matriarch in each group so their movements could be tracked in their new","w":0.72245630900065105,"x":0.067898837000613721},{"y":0.53517348289601108,"x":0.069840283716426269,"c":1,"t":"home. Measurements were taken of each elephant's tusks - elephants with large tusks would","w":0.73991984049479165,"h":0.017289572267146114},{"h":0.017532984415690067,"y":0.55174986590462716,"c":1,"x":0.06980438437826858,"w":0.72638951619466141,"t":"be at greater risk from poachers - and also of their feet. The elephants were then taken to a"},{"t":"recovery area before being loaded onto trucks and transported to their new home.","c":1,"w":0.65067484537760412,"y":0.5671913342127396,"h":0.018914337990068475,"x":0.067849997184038724},{"y":0.59214985235559892,"w":0.71665603637695308,"c":1,"t":"The elephants translocated to Nkhotakota settled in very well and the project has generally","h":0.018454918311763713,"x":0.069829613439931396},{"t":"been accepted to have been a huge success - and not just for the elephants. Employment","y":0.60901162799736075,"c":1,"h":0.015988371899566145,"x":0.069902911476211402,"w":0.71844660441080732},{"t":"prospects have improved enormously, contributing to rising living standards tor the whole","x":0.069902924412073589,"h":0.014668007134648553,"c":1,"w":0.70291259765624992,"y":0.62645348807913348},{"w":0.73615524291992185,"t":"community. Poaching is no longer an issue, as former poachers are able to find more reliable","x":0.067850368827792995,"y":0.64022976411775545,"h":0.020113253964813338,"c":1},{"w":0.73398056030273429,"c":1,"t":"sources of income. In fact, many of them volunteered to give up their weapons, as they were","x":0.069902923636956688,"h":0.016024596074659891,"y":0.65843023265223832},{"t":"no longer of any use to them.","w":0.23495145161946612,"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1,"x":0.069902914865702756,"y":0.6758720933194452},{"w":0.73413736979166666,"y":0.69714398102028363,"x":0.071762177753303152,"h":0.017281835324296391,"t":"More than two dozen elephants have been born at Nkhotakota since relocation. With an area","c":1},{"h":0.019877061219973013,"y":0.71185596442727983,"w":0.70313354492187508,"t":"of more than 1,800 square kilometres, there's plenty of space for the elephant population","x":0.069787118552659941,"c":1},{"x":0.069826942538967957,"t":"to continue to grow. Their presence is also helping to rebalance Nkhotakota's damaged","c":1,"h":0.018500626347146665,"y":0.72932235513573851,"w":0.68948354085286456},{"w":0.69533584594726561,"h":0.017214723390953535,"c":1,"y":0.74544383042670659,"t":"ecosystem and providing a sustainable conservation model, which could be replicated in","x":0.073695263806862379},{"x":0.069819465413959558,"y":0.76123573229402508,"w":0.7244392395019531,"h":0.018288626032083588,"c":1,"t":"other parks. All this has been a big draw for tourism, which contributes five times more than"},{"t":"the illegal wildlife trade to GDP, and this is mainly because of the elephants. There's also","y":0.77735806738630164,"w":0.70117558797200519,"x":0.069793048985577338,"h":0.019098075082368937,"c":1},{"x":0.071722955582774611,"h":0.016101651771046277,"t":"been a dramatic rise in interest ...","y":0.79506967234002468,"w":0.27016006469726561,"c":1},{"w":0.062135918935140033,"c":1,"x":0.84077670062258258,"t":"Test 1","y":0.034883721208281426,"h":0.014648988907953631},{"w":0.03689320246378569,"t":"Q31","y":0.11627906964605694,"c":1,"x":0.83106796177781583,"h":0.01308139551465759},{"w":0.036893202463785801,"t":"Q32","h":0.01308139551465759,"x":0.83106796178923792,"y":0.27616279057628956,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Q33","x":0.83106796173723196,"h":0.014534883112922392,"y":0.30813953514497516,"w":0.038834950129191137},{"c":1,"x":0.83300970958364118,"y":0.38081395364702719,"t":"Q34","w":0.036893202463785801,"h":0.014534883112922392},{"c":1,"x":0.8330097096661655,"w":0.036893202463785801,"t":"Q35","y":0.43750000012231793,"h":0.014534883112922281},{"t":"Q36","x":0.83300970935602514,"y":0.4883720929040084,"w":0.036893202463785801,"c":1,"h":0.01308139551465759},{"y":0.53488372115348715,"c":1,"t":"Q37","w":0.036893202463785801,"h":0.014534883112922281,"x":0.83300970943693131},{"c":1,"t":"Q38","y":0.60901162778772933,"w":0.036893202463785801,"h":0.01308139551465759,"x":0.83300970935602514},{"x":0.83300970935602514,"y":0.65697674406679918,"h":0.01308139551465759,"t":"Q39","c":1,"w":0.036893202463785801},{"c":1,"y":0.95203488395886648,"x":0.86796116571426774,"h":0.014534883112922281,"t":"103","w":0.036893202463785801}]}